ps://si.imgix.net/621b724b/uploads/origins/99a196a5-acf8-4066-8158-19ee9cd0ccb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c501cf370e1262d3f5e39ee9eeb09274 2x, https://si.imgix.net/621b724b/uploads/origins/99a196a5-acf8-4066-8158-19ee9cd0ccb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59eb661e013a3f25ea1f579639a1fa58 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/621b724b/uploads/origins/99a196a5-acf8-4066-8158-19ee9cd0ccb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e8a9c9946b284566c9b2d258b1f5875b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/621b724b/uploads/origins/99a196a5-acf8-4066-8158-19ee9cd0ccb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e8a9c9946b284566c9b2d258b1f5875b, https://si.imgix.net/621b724b/uploads/origins/99a196a5-acf8-4066-8158-19ee9cd0ccb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c362e2709fb1eead36a150902a02ee3a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/621b724b/uploads/origins/99a196a5-acf8-4066-8158-19ee9cd0ccb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=89e830d72934892d9f9c5bb02bf54d65 3x"}, "body": "Dear Amami, nice to meet you.\nMy name is Rira Mizusei, and I am an individual VTuber.\n\nI saw your beautiful, delicate, and transparent illustrations on X (formerly Twitter), and I would like to request a drawing of my own.\n\nHere are the details of your request.\n\nIntended use\nUse in general Vtuber activities including YouTube, thumbnails, Twitter, etc.\nUse in icons, channel art, headers, etc.\nLimited distribution as wallpaper in FANBOX, online printing, etc.\netc. We would appreciate it if you could let us know in the data if there is anything that cannot be used.\n\nReference materials\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JyPIJjhKaBbLk2oG2l5UbI6GBE3e7rsT\nThe star pattern highlights in the eyes and the inner color of the hair is a gradation with glitter and lame. Also, the pattern of the skirt is the Kotomiza mark, ✨.\n\nComposition, size, etc.\nWe would like to have a drawing of her with white hair (normal), and would appreciate it if you could draw her with either of the following impressions.\nI would appreciate it if you could draw her with either of the following impressions: ・https://x.com/yamagamiamami/status/1891793643586937063?s=46&t=pxwXoLagU5ITXc8xZgPvoQ\n→Bright, energetic and cute\nhttps://x.com/yamagamiamami/status/1772995425425142163?s=46&t=pxwXoLagU5ITXc8xZgPvoQ\n→Pale and fragile impression\n\nWe feel the delicacy and transparency of Amami's world view is very wonderful, so we would be happy if you could leave the specific composition, pose, facial expressions, etc. to us and draw them as you think of them!\n\nOther requests\nPlease make sure that the person and his/her hair are not visible so that they can be used as thumbnails, etc.\nAlso, if possible, we would appreciate it if you could provide us with PSD data with separate transparencies for signatures, backgrounds, and figures only.\n\nWe understand that you are very busy, but we would appreciate your consideration when you have time.", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yamagamiamami/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2184966, "client_id": 3075940, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c39ce9a8/uploads/origins/d902e8b7-b090-48f8-bc45-3456c5e67518?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b0e6333eb9b48ca7df01c83508de9f5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c39ce9a8/uploads/origins/d902e8b7-b090-48f8-bc45-3456c5e67518?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b0e6333eb9b48ca7df01c83508de9f5, https://si.i