ron, and I always enjoy looking at your wonderful illustrations on X (old Twitter) 🌼.\nI love Amami's illustrations so much that I requested ☺️ I hope you can draw my guess 🥀.\n\n(I would be happy if you could draw my guesses 🥀.)\n◆Fan art of Rui Takamine from \"Hollow Live\nI would like to have a drawing of Louie Takamine from \"HoloLive\".\nAny costume (original one is fine)\nFree background (single color or none)\nLayers are not specified.\nSize: 1000 x 1500 pixel or more (portrait preferred)\nThe size should be 1000×1500pixel or more (portrait size is preferred).\nPlease choose a method that is easy for Amami to do.\n\n(Important point).\nI would like to use it for my personal cell phone wallpaper and SNS icons.\nI will never use the illustrations in any way that you would find offensive or misuse them.\n\n(Talking about secondary creation)\nI have researched about the secondary creation of Hololive, and I believe that it is not against the guideline as it is a skeb request for the purpose of personal adoration.\nIf you are concerned, don't hesitate to cancel.\n\nI have no experience with skeb requests, so I apologize if my request is poorly worded.\nIf this is not convenient for you, please cancel the request.\nThank you for your consideration ✨", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yamagamiamami/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2184966, "client_id": 300145, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9ae644fa/uploads/origins/b685b597-31fc-40ed-bd36-1ecfa802f581?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=11f36545b0124f95f2c9a5be559e4bc3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9ae644fa/uploads/origins/b685b597-31fc-40ed-bd36-1ecfa802f581?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=11f36545b0124f95f2c9a5be559e4bc3, https://si.imgix.net/9ae